<section class="about-main wrap">

  <div class="about-copy">

    <h2>
      About The Brooklyn Dispatch
    </h2>

    <p>
      The Brooklyn Dispatch began from a simple observation. The experience
      of art rarely ends when the credits roll or the final page is turned.
      The conversations, journeys and habits that follow are often just as
      interesting as the work itself.
    </p>

    <p>
      This publication explores those afterlives.
    </p>

  </div>

</section>


