    <h3>
      Steve Berkowitz
    </h3>

    <div class="contributor-profile__bio">

      <p>
        I grew up in London, England and, after living across the American
        Midwest and West Coast, I now live on the East Coast in Brooklyn,
        New York. I previously lived in Philadelphia.
      </p>

      <p>
        I've always been interested in the ways films, books and music shape
        how we experience places, conversations and everyday life. Over the
        years I found myself keeping notes after finishing a novel, leaving
        the cinema or discovering a new album.
      </p>

      <p>
        The Brooklyn Dispatch grew naturally from that habit. It is a place
        to collect essays, notebooks and an evolving shelf of films, books,
        music and places that continue the conversation.
      </p>

    </div>

